WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:05.833
"I want Bot, not a new robot."

2
00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:09.067
Ringo was back in his room.

3
00:00:09.068 --> 00:00:11.217
He tapped his chin.

4
00:00:11.218 --> 00:00:13.877
"I have to get a hex link."

5
00:00:13.878 --> 00:00:16.202
Ringo had a plan.

6
00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:19.779
"I can fly to Rusty Moon—really fast.

7
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:25.741
I'll get back in time for the inspection."

8
00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:28.422
Ringo peeked into the hallway.

9
00:00:28.423 --> 00:00:32.096
Nobody was there.

10
00:00:32.097 --> 00:00:42.007
He grabbed Bot and ran.

11
00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:45.474
Ringo got into a spaceship.

12
00:00:45.475 --> 00:00:51.877
He put Bot in her seat.

13
00:00:51.878 --> 00:00:55.413
"Bot can't fly," Ringo thought.

14
00:00:55.414 --> 00:00:58.091
"So I'll have to do it."

15
00:00:58.092 --> 00:01:00.555
Ringo pressed a button.

16
00:01:00.556 --> 00:01:06.306
The spaceship hummed.

17
00:01:06.307 --> 00:01:09.752
"Blast off!" Ringo said.

18
00:01:09.753 --> 00:01:15.788
The spaceship took off.

19
00:01:15.789 --> 00:01:20.207
"What is going on?" someone said.

20
00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:22.082
Ringo turned around.

21
00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:24.139
It was Lucy!

22
00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.765
"Why are you in here?" Ringo asked.

23
00:01:27.766 --> 00:01:31.315
"I was cleaning," Lucy said.

24
00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:34.483
"Where are we going?"

25
00:01:34.484 --> 00:01:37.433
Ringo told her.

26
00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:40.557
"We have to get back in time," he said.

27
00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:43.793
"Or Captain Nova will be mad at me."

28
00:01:43.794 --> 00:01:46.268
Lucy frowned.

29
00:01:46.269 --> 00:01:50.249
"You'll have a bigger problem than that, Tiny.

30
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.232
I'll be mad at you too!"

31
00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:59.898
Ringo gulped.

